[reply] 

I arranged the Local file table from a flat view (no measures) to a grouped table showing the sum of Amount by Region, with a grand-total row enabled.

**Results from preview.rows:**

| Region | Total Amount |
|--------|-------------|
| East   | 360         |
| North  | 210         |
| West   | 615         |

A grand-total row is shown. No warnings.

Undo is available.

